recommendations.recommendation:
Keep one shared protocol.ts with discriminated unions.

Host to webview:
- snapshot{version, nodes, edges, order}
- patch{from, to, ops} (the webview requests a snapshot when it detects a version gap)
- proposal{proposal|null}
- llm/status{state}
- llm/question{id, text, choices?}
- response{requestId, ok, result|error}

Webview to host:
- ready{lastVersion}
- request{requestId, method, params}, where method is one of createNode{kind, text, rationale}, moveNode{id, kind, before}, proveGoal{premises, goal}, acceptProposal, rejectProposal, sendFeedback{proposalId, text, nodeComments}, answerQuestion, openInEditor, openRawDiff

EdgeDTO carries kind 'verified' | 'intended'. Wrap acquireVsCodeApi once in host.ts (dev builds get a mock host). Use vscode-messenger 0.7.0 or a 60-line custom RPC.
